<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION.</p>
<p>TANKERS.</p>
<p>New Brooklyn - (built 1973) 229,727 dwt sold to Bangladeshi breakers for $178.5 plt.</p>
<p>BULKERS.</p>
<p>Indomitable - (built 1972) 77,996 dwt sold for $165 plt.w</p>
<p>ORE CARRIER.</p>
<p>Larina - (built 1972) 178,750 dwt sold to Pakistani breakers for $165 plt.</p>
<p>CONTAINER CARRIER.</p>
<p>Hanjin Tonghae - (built 1978) 25,444 dwt plus sistership Hanjin Masan - (built 1979) sold for $146 plt as is.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to survey, inspection or other conditions.</p>
</text>
